§ `fixtures`

`a trader who made 1.2 million last year` MEANS `My year of business` WITH
    `I am already registered` IS FALSE
    `my taxable supplies made in Singapore in the calendar year` IS 1200000
    `of those, sales of my business's capital assets` IS 0
    `I belong in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `my Seventh Schedule supplies under paragraph 3(2)(b)(ii) and (3A) in the calendar year` IS 0
    `the Comptroller is satisfied next calendar year will not exceed $1 million` IS FALSE

`a trader who made exactly 1 million` MEANS `My year of business` WITH
    `I am already registered` IS FALSE
    `my taxable supplies made in Singapore in the calendar year` IS 1000000
    `of those, sales of my business's capital assets` IS 0
    `I belong in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `my Seventh Schedule supplies under paragraph 3(2)(b)(ii) and (3A) in the calendar year` IS 0
    `the Comptroller is satisfied next calendar year will not exceed $1 million` IS FALSE

`a trader over 1 million whom the Comptroller is satisfied will drop below` MEANS `My year of business` WITH
    `I am already registered` IS FALSE
    `my taxable supplies made in Singapore in the calendar year` IS 1200000
    `of those, sales of my business's capital assets` IS 0
    `I belong in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `my Seventh Schedule supplies under paragraph 3(2)(b)(ii) and (3A) in the calendar year` IS 0
    `the Comptroller is satisfied next calendar year will not exceed $1 million` IS TRUE

`a trader whose 1.2 million includes selling the business premises for 300000` MEANS `My year of business` WITH
