    `the Comptroller is satisfied next calendar year will not exceed $1 million` IS FALSE

§ `First Schedule paras 1, 1A, 1C`

#ASSERT `Am I liable to be registered at the end of the calendar year` `a trader who made 1.2 million last year`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I liable to be registered at the end of the calendar year` `a trader who made exactly 1 million`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I liable to be registered at the end of the calendar year` `a trader over 1 million whom the Comptroller is satisfied will drop below`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I liable to be registered at the end of the calendar year` `a trader whose 1.2 million includes selling the business premises for 300000`
#ASSERT `Am I liable to be registered at the end of the calendar year` `a trader in Singapore with Seventh Schedule supplies on top`

#ASSERT `Am I liable to be registered now on what I expect` FALSE 1500000 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Am I liable to be registered now on what I expect` FALSE 1500000 FALSE

#ASSERT `Am I liable to be registered as an overseas seller at the end of the calendar year` 5000000 150000 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Am I liable to be registered as an overseas seller at the end of the calendar year` 5000000 90000 FALSE

§ `First Schedule paras 4, 5, 10`

#ASSERT `By when must I notify my liability for the calendar year` 2025 EQUALS Date 30 1 2026

#ASSERT `From when am I registered after the calendar year` 2025 NOTHING EQUALS Date 1 3 2026

#ASSERT `By when must I notify my liability on what I expect` (Date 15 8 2025) EQUALS Date 14 9 2025

#ASSERT `From when am I registered on what I expect` (Date 15 8 2025) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS Date 15 10 2025
#ASSERT `From when am I registered on what I expect` (Date 31 12 2025) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `From when am I registered on what I expect` (Date 10 3 2025) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS Date 10 4 2025
#ASSERT `From when am I registered on what I expect` (Date 15 8 2025) TRUE NOTHING EQUALS Date 15 8 2025

#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Comptroller I have stopped` (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS Date 19 4 2026

§ `s 49(2)`

#ASSERT `By when must I object to the Comptroller's decision` (Date 1 2 2026) NOTHING EQUALS Date 3 3 2026

§ `ss 60, 61`

#ASSERT `What is my penalty for paying late` 10000 TRUE 1 EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `What is my penalty for paying late` 10000 FALSE 3 EQUALS 1100
#ASSERT `What is my penalty for paying late` 10000 FALSE 30 EQUALS 5500

#ASSERT `What is my penalty for a late return` 0 EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `What is my penalty for a late return` 3 EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `What is my penalty for a late return` 60 EQUALS 10000

#ASSERT `What is my penalty for failing to register` 50000 EQUALS 5000

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for failing to register` 10 EQUALS 10500

§ `ss 59, 62`

#ASSERT (`What can I be made to pay for an incorrect return` `an incorrect return, without more` 4000)'s `the penalty` EQUALS 4000
#ASSERT (`What can I be made to pay for an incorrect return` `without reasonable excuse or through negligence` 4000)'s `the penalty` EQUALS 8000
#ASSERT (`What can I be made to pay for an incorrect return` `wilfully with intent to evade tax` 4000)'s `the most months I can be imprisoned` EQUALS 84
